# AgentRef — environment reference
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in only what you need. The app runs fully with
# NO GenLayer configuration (it uses the clearly-labelled SIMULATED adjudicator).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GenLayer (optional, for the REAL validator path)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# After deploying genlayer/contract.py (see genlayer/README.md), set:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENTREF_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=0x...
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENTREF_NETWORK=testnet_bradbury
# NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENTREF_CHAIN_KEY=studionet

# Server-only: signer for submitting disputes. NEVER prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_,
# never commit. Fund the account on the target network first.
# AGENTREF_ACCOUNT_PRIVATE_KEY=
